  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "One quarter of the ward that seals the hidden court beneath Amon S\u00fbl. The break is not clean: it was struck apart, and each piece was given to a different watch of the garrison so that no one of them could open the door alone.\n\nIt is far heavier than a shard of iron this size has any right to be. Four such wards, laid together in the old oven below and woken by the lever beside it, will make a key again.\n\nTaken from a Barrow-wight of Amon S\u00fbl."
    }
